cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this workflow, please cite it as below."
title: "ddRAD-Seq Workflow"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible bash workflow for ddRAD-Seq data processing and
  population genomic analyses, covering raw FASTQ through spacer
  removal, demultiplexing, QC, trimming, alignment, variant calling,
  filtering, and downstream analyses (PCA, admixture, hybrid index).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mishra
    given-names: Bharat
    affiliation: "Genomics & Bioinformatics Core Facility, University of Notre Dame"
license: GPL-3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/bmishra2/ddRADSeq_workflow_2026"
date-released: "2026-04-06"
keywords:
  - ddRAD-Seq
  - population genomics
  - bioinformatics
  - SNP calling
  - admixture
  - hybrid detection
